    "text": "actionnewsnow.com\nwebsite\nGridley\nGridley High School student faces sentencing Wednesday for classmate stabbing incident\n8 hours ago\nA 15-year-old who admitted to stabbing a classmate at Gridley High School was set to be sentenced. The teenager confessed in May to stabbing another student in the back inside the locker room before leaving the campus in March. The victim required multiple surgeries but has since been released and is recovering. The teenager could face up to seven years in juvenile hall.\n1",
